//! The `leanexport` reference type discipline of [TYPES-DISCIPLINE-REFERENCE] and
//! [PROOF-SOURCE-LEAN] (specs 0050 and 0049): a module marked
//! `// osprey: types=leanexport` cites Lean theorems it relies on, each with the
//! pinned `lean4export` certificate that proves it. The checker re-checks every
//! certificate's whole dependency closure with Osprey's kernel from an empty
//! environment, trusting nothing Lean said, and erases the citation lines.
//!
//! A second dependent discipline beside `dependent`: the same seam and the
//! same kernel, a different source of proofs.

namespace lean

import bounded::Checker


main () = Checker::serve Citations::judge
